# The default output directories, anchored to the repository root.
#
# `snapshot/` without the leading slash matches at ANY depth, so it also
# excluded src/snapshot, which is the module that reads and writes one. The
# repository pushed without it, every other file that imports it failed to
# typecheck, and CI reported five missing-module errors rather than one
# missing file. A pattern that quietly drops source is worth five characters
# to anchor.
/snapshot/
/mapping.json
/shots/
